00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
EPA 608: Federal certification required by the Clean Air Act to purchase or
handle any refrigerant. Without it, you cannot legally work on AC or
refrigeration systems.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
OSHA 10: 10-hour construction safety certification delivered through CareerSafe.
DOL wallet card issued upon completion. Required by most HVAC employers.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
ETPL: Eligible Training Provider List — state-approved programs that qualify for
WIOA workforce funding.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
